{
  "config_version": 1,
  "run_name": "kd_v1_s42",
  "seed": 42,
  "model": {
    "path": "models/SmolVLM-256M-Instruct",
    "dtype": "bfloat16",
    "freeze_vision_tower": true,
    "gradient_checkpointing": true,
    "local_files_only": true
  },
  "lora": {
    "r": 16,
    "lora_alpha": 32,
    "lora_dropout": 0.05,
    "target_modules": ["q_proj", "k_proj", "v_proj", "o_proj"],
    "target_scope": "model.text_model",
    "task_type": "CAUSAL_LM",
    "bias": "none"
  },
  "image": {
    "image_size": 384,
    "do_image_splitting": false,
    "patch_size": 16,
    "scale_factor": 4,
    "expected_image_seq_len": 36
  },
  "answer": {
    "format": "[{x1}, {y1}, {x2}, {y2}]",
    "precision": 4,
    "eos_token_id": 49279,
    "pad_token_id": 2
  },
  "data": {
    "train": [
      {
        "path": "data/synthetic_train.jsonl",
        "source": "synthetic",
        "split": "train",
        "limit": null,
        "select": "first"
      },
      {
        "path": "data/refcoco_train.jsonl",
        "source": "refcoco",
        "split": "train",
        "limit": null,
        "select": "first"
      },
      {
        "path": "data/kd/kd_train.jsonl",
        "source": "kd",
        "split": "train",
        "limit": null,
        "select": "first"
      }
    ],
    "val": [
      {
        "path": "data/synthetic_eval.jsonl",
        "source": "synthetic",
        "split": "eval",
        "limit": null
      },
      {
        "path": "data/refcoco_val.jsonl",
        "source": "refcoco",
        "split": "val",
        "limit": null
      }
    ],
    "id_intersection_must_be_zero": true,
    "example_cache_max": 200
  },
  "training": {
    "batch_size": 1,
    "gradient_accumulation_steps": 8,
    "effective_batch_size": 8,
    "learning_rate": 0.0001,
    "weight_decay": 0.0,
    "num_epochs": 1,
    "save_every_steps": 200,
    "log_every_steps": 1,
    "lr_scheduler": "cosine",
    "warmup_ratio": 0.03,
    "max_grad_norm": 1.0,
    "max_steps": null
  },
  "probe": {
    "records": "val",
    "n": 20,
    "max_new_tokens": 64,
    "do_sample": false
  },
  "output": {
    "dir": "adapters/kd_v1",
    "log": "logs/train/kd_v1.jsonl"
  },
  "notes": "T12 KD (kd_v1_s42): D0 (5,000 synthetic) + D+ (5,000 RefCOCO) + the teacher-response pool data/kd/kd_train.jsonl (source=kd, produced by src/train/teacher_gen.py from Qwen2.5-VL-3B-Instruct, IoU>=0.5 filter against GT). Same fixed contract and compute budget as T6/T9: LoRA r16/alpha32, lr 1e-4 cosine warmup 0.03, batch1 x grad-accum 8, image 384 no-splitting image_seq_len 36, EOS 49279 / PAD 2, seed 42, 1,250 optimizer steps / 10,000 micro-batches (~1 epoch). This is RESPONSE distillation, not logit KD: teacher (Qwen2.5-VL-3B) and student (SmolVLM-256M) have different vocabularies (paper §6.5), so only the teacher's text answer is transferred. Single-seed pilot (seed 42): G6 evidence only, never a significance claim or a 3-seed main-table row. Baseline for comparison is the seed42 SFT run (reused, never re-run). GPU execution requires an explicit Lead lease."
}
